{{ dialogue_text }}
{% if include_structure %}

=== STRUCTURE (per interaction — tools, duration, files touched, errors) ===
{{ structure_text }}
{% endif %}
{% if delegated_text %}

=== DELEGATED (subagents, workflows, background tasks this session ran — and what came back) ===
{{ delegated_text }}
{% endif %}
{% if artifacts_text %}

